<div class="trusted">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p>Une couche d’orchestration au-dessus du meilleur de l’IA vocale</p>
    <div class="trusted__g" id="trustedG"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ═══ PLATEFORME — onglets ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="sec" id="plateforme">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec__hd rv">
      <p class="kicker"><i></i>La plateforme</p>
      <h2 class="d-lg">Construire, déployer, superviser.<br>Au même endroit.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="rv" style="--d:60ms">
      <div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Capacités de la plateforme">
        <button class="tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Construire</button>
        <button class="tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Déployer</button>
        <button class="tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Latence</button>
        <button class="tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Superviser</button>
      </div>
      <div class="show">
        <div class="show__c">
          <div class="copy on">
            <h3>L’agent, écrit en clair</h3>
            <p>Identité, missions, garde-fous. En langage clair.</p>
            <ul>
              <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-agent"/></svg>Prompt structuré, versionné, testable</li>
              <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-kb"/></svg>RAG sur vos documents, 80 ms</li>
              <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-tools"/></svg>CRM, agenda, webhook pendant l’appel</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="copy">
            <h3>Sur vos numéros, sans migration</h3>
            <p>Nos numéros, votre SIP ou votre CCaaS.</p>
            <ul>
              <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-phone"/></svg>Numéros FR et UE gérés par Callem</li>
              <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-sip"/></svg>Raccordement SIP à votre plateau</li>
              <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-campaign"/></svg>Campagnes sortantes, 50 000 appels/jour</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="copy">
            <h3>Sous 600 ms, bout en bout</h3>
            <p>L’appelant n’attend jamais son tour de parole.</p>
            <ul>
              <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-live"/></svg>VAD sémantique — l’agent attend la fin de la phrase</li>
              <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-analytics"/></svg>Décomposition visible sur chaque appel</li>
              <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-eu"/></svg>Inférence exécutée à Paris</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="copy">
            <h3>100 % des appels analysés</h3>
            <p>Aucun échantillonnage. Alertes sur vos seuils.</p>
            <ul>
              <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-live"/></svg>Écoute live et intervention humaine</li>
              <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-alert"/></svg>Seuils et alertes configurables</li>
              <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-workflow"/></svg>Tests A/B sur prompts et modèles</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="show__m">
          <div class="pane on">
            <div class="app">
              <div class="app__bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i>
                <b>callem.ai/studio / <em>Assistant Commercial — Acme</em></b></div>
              <div class="app__b">
                <div class="fld"><label>Identité</label>
                  <div>Vous êtes un assistant commercial professionnel pour Acme Corp. Ton chaleureux et professionnel.</div></div>
                <div class="fld"><label>Missions</label>
                  <div class="foc">Qualifier les leads sur le budget, l’échéance et le pouvoir de décision.</div></div>
                <div class="fld"><label>Garde-fous</label>
                  <div class="bare"><span class="gl">
                    <span><svg class="no" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"
                      stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18"/></svg>Ne jamais confirmer un prix</span>
                    <span><svg class="no" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"
                      stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18"/></svg>Aucun conseil médical</span>
                    <span><svg class="yes" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6"
                      stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12.5 9.5 18 20 6.5"/></svg>Toujours vérifier l’identité</span>
                  </span></div></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mini mini--br"><b>Mise en production</b><span class="v">4 j</span>
              <span class="s">du prompt au numéro</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="pane">
            <div class="app">
              <div class="app__bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>callem.ai/studio / <em>Canaux</em></b></div>
              <div class="app__b">
                <div class="chan">
                  <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-phone"/></svg>+33 1 84 88 00 00</span>
                  <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-sip"/></svg>Trunk SIP · actif</span>
                  <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-chat"/></svg>Webchat · site</span>
                  <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-campaign"/></svg>Sortant · 50k/j</span>
                </div>
                <div class="fld"><label>Zone de traitement</label><div>eu-west-paris — aucun transit hors UE</div></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mini mini--bl"><b>Langues</b><span class="v">25+</span><span class="s">européennes</span></div>
            <div class="mini mini--br"><b>Télécom</b><span class="v">SIP</span><span class="s">en propre</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="pane">
            <div class="app">
              <div class="app__bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>callem.ai/studio / <em>Latence bout-en-bout</em></b></div>
              <div class="app__b">
                <div class="lat">
                  <div><span>STT</span><span class="bar" style="--w:15%"></span><em>90 ms</em></div>
                  <div><span>RAG</span><span class="bar" style="--w:13%"></span><em>80 ms</em></div>
                  <div><span>LLM</span><span class="bar" style="--w:30%"></span><em>180 ms</em></div>
                  <div><span>TTS</span><span class="bar" style="--w:25%"></span><em>150 ms</em></div>
                  <div><span>Réseau</span><span class="bar" style="--w:17%"></span><em>100 ms</em></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mini mini--br"><b>Bout en bout</b><span class="v">~600 ms</span>
              <span class="s">l’appelant n’attend pas</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="pane">
            <div class="app">
              <div class="app__bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>callem.ai/studio / <em>Analytics</em></b></div>
              <div class="app__b">
                <div class="fld"><label>Appels analysés · 30 jours</label>
                  <div class="bare"><span class="spark" id="spark" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></div>
                <div class="chan">
                  <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-analytics"/></svg>Sentiment · positif 78 %</span>
                  <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-alert"/></svg>Alerte · seuil 30 %</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mini mini--bl"><b>Couverture</b><span class="v">100 %</span><span class="s">aucun échantillon</span></div>
            <div class="mini mini--br"><b>Résolus</b><span class="v">70 %</span><span class="s">sans humain</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ SECTEURS ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="sec sec--soft" id="secteurs">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hd-row rv">
      <div class="sec__hd">
        <p class="kicker"><i></i>Secteurs</p>
        <h2 class="d-lg">Cinq métiers,<br>un même moteur.</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#demo">Parler de votre cas</a>
    </div>
    <div class="sw-shell rv" style="--d:80ms">
      <div class="swiper sw">
      <div class="swiper-wrapper">
        <div class="swiper-slide"><a class="sect__i" href="#demo"><span class="sect__art pic"><img class="" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1616924451835-747bd5cd08ee?auto=format&fit=crop&w=640&q=72" alt="Quartier d’affaires, tours de bureaux" loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="(max-width:900px) 90vw, 260px"><b>01</b><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-lock"/></svg></span>
        <span class="sect__b"><h3>Finance</h3><p>Identité vérifiée. Aucun conseil financier.</p></span></a></div>
        <div class="swiper-slide"><a class="sect__i" href="#demo"><span class="sect__art pic"><img class="" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1578991624414-276ef23a534f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=640&q=72" alt="Accueil d’un établissement de santé" loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="(max-width:900px) 90vw, 260px"><b>02</b><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-shield"/></svg></span>
        <span class="sect__b"><h3>Santé</h3><p>Rendez-vous et rappels. Zéro conseil médical.</p></span></a></div>
        <div class="swiper-slide"><a class="sect__i" href="#demo"><span class="sect__art pic"><img class="" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1591085686350-798c0f9faa7f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=640&q=72" alt="Cliente dans une boutique" loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="(max-width:900px) 90vw, 260px"><b>03</b><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-campaign"/></svg></span>
        <span class="sect__b"><h3>Retail</h3><p>Suivi, retours, réclamations. Pics absorbés.</p></span></a></div>
        <div class="swiper-slide"><a class="sect__i" href="#demo"><span class="sect__art pic"><img class="" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560264357-8d9202250f21?auto=format&fit=crop&w=640&q=72" alt="Deux conseillers en rendez-vous" loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="(max-width:900px) 90vw, 260px"><b>04</b><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-transfer"/></svg></span>
        <span class="sect__b"><h3>Assurance</h3><p>Sinistres guidés. Escalade encadrée.</p></span></a></div>
        <div class="swiper-slide"><a class="sect__i" href="#demo"><span class="sect__art pic"><img class="" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559589688-6ba6beafe1e5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=640&q=72" alt="Drapeau européen devant un bâtiment public" loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="(max-width:900px) 90vw, 260px"><b>05</b><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-eu"/></svg></span>
        <span class="sect__b"><h3>Pouvoirs publics</h3><p>Accueil continu, 25+ langues.</p></span></a></div>
      </div></div>
        <div class="sw-ui">
          <button class="sw-btn sw-prev" type="button" aria-label="Précédent">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"
              stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M19 12H6M12 5l-7 7 7 7"/></svg></button>
          <button class="sw-btn sw-next" type="button" aria-label="Suivant">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"
              stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h13M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></button>
          <span class="sw-bar"><i></i></span>
          <span class="sw-hint">Faites glisser</span>
        </div>
      </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ CHIFFRES ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="sec" id="resultats">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band rv">
      <p class="kicker"><i></i>Résultats</p>
      <h2 class="d-lg">Ce que ça change,<br>dès le premier mois.</h2>
      <div class="band__g">
        <div><span class="band__v" data-to="30" data-pre="−" data-suf="&nbsp;%">−0&nbsp;%</span>
          <span class="band__l">de coûts opérationnels</span></div>
        <div><span class="band__v" data-to="70" data-suf="&nbsp;%">0&nbsp;%</span>
          <span class="band__l">résolus sans humain</span></div>
        <div><span class="band__v" data-to="10" data-pre="+" data-suf="&nbsp;pts">+0&nbsp;pts</span>
          <span class="band__l">de NPS</span></div>
        <div><span class="band__v" data-to="6" data-pre="&lt;&nbsp;" data-suf="&nbsp;mois">&lt;&nbsp;0&nbsp;mois</span>
          <span class="band__l">de retour sur investissement</span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="band__note">Déploiements en production · benchmarks Forrester et Gartner.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ HISTOIRES ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="sec sec--soft">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec__hd rv">
      <p class="kicker"><i></i>Sur le terrain</p>
      <h2 class="d-lg">Trois usages, trois résultats.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="sw-shell rv" style="--d:80ms">
      <div class="swiper sw">
      <div class="swiper-wrapper">
        <div class="swiper-slide"><div class="story__i">
        <div class="story__plate pic"><img class="" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580795479225-c50ab8c3348d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=720&q=72" alt="Conseillère avec casque en centre de contact" loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="(max-width:900px) 90vw, 380px"><span class="story__logo"><svg viewBox="0 0 116 24" role="img" aria-label="Genesys"><use href="#lg-genesys"/></svg></span></div>
        <div class="story__b">
          <p class="story__q">Le standard ne sonne plus dans le vide, la nuit.</p>
          
          <div class="story__m"><div><b>24/7</b><span>couverture</span></div><div><b>0</b><span>migration</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </div></div>
        <div class="swiper-slide"><div class="story__i">
        <div class="story__plate pic"><img class="" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516055619834-586f8c75d1de?auto=format&fit=crop&w=720&q=72" alt="Homme au téléphone en extérieur" loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="(max-width:900px) 90vw, 380px"><span class="story__logo"><svg viewBox="0 0 136 24" role="img" aria-label="Salesforce"><use href="#lg-salesforce"/></svg></span></div>
        <div class="story__b">
          <p class="story__q">Les leads arrivent qualifiés dans le CRM.</p>
          
          <div class="story__m"><div><b>×3</b><span>leads traités</span></div><div><b>8/10</b><span>score moyen</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </div></div>
        <div class="swiper-slide"><div class="story__i">
        <div class="story__plate pic"><img class="" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1525182008055-f88b95ff7980?auto=format&fit=crop&w=720&q=72" alt="Conseiller au téléphone à son bureau" loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="(max-width:900px) 90vw, 380px"><span class="story__logo"><svg viewBox="0 0 106 24" role="img" aria-label="Cal.com"><use href="#lg-calcom"/></svg></span></div>
        <div class="story__b">
          <p class="story__q">Les rendez-vous se prennent pendant l’appel.</p>
          
          <div class="story__m"><div><b>140 ms</b><span>réservation</span></div><div><b>−50 %</b><span>no-show</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </div></div>
      </div></div>
        <div class="sw-ui">
          <button class="sw-btn sw-prev" type="button" aria-label="Précédent">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"
              stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M19 12H6M12 5l-7 7 7 7"/></svg></button>
          <button class="sw-btn sw-next" type="button" aria-label="Suivant">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"
              stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h13M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></button>
          <span class="sw-bar"><i></i></span>
          <span class="sw-hint">Faites glisser</span>
        </div>
      </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ CONTRÔLE ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="sec" id="controle">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec__hd rv">
      <p class="kicker"><i></i>Contrôle</p>
      <h2 class="d-lg">Trois couches, parce qu’aucune<br>IA n’est fiable à 100&nbsp;%.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="tri">
      <div class="tri__i rv"><p class="tri__t">01 · AVANT</p>
        <h3>Sécuriser avant de livrer</h3>
        
        <ul>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-shield"/></svg>Garde-fous entrée et sortie</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-lock"/></svg>Masquage des données personnelles</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-test"/></svg>Tests sur les cas limites</li>
        </ul></div>
      <div class="tri__i rv" style="--d:90ms"><p class="tri__t">02 · PENDANT</p>
        <h3>Observer et intervenir</h3>
        
        <ul>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-live"/></svg>Supervision live</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-alert"/></svg>Alertes sur anomalie</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-transfer"/></svg>Escalade avec le contexte</li>
        </ul></div>
      <div class="tri__i rv" style="--d:180ms"><p class="tri__t">03 · APRÈS</p>
        <h3>Évaluer chaque appel</h3>
        
        <ul>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-analytics"/></svg>Scoring hallucination</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-workflow"/></svg>Expérimentations A/B</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-kb"/></svg>Chaque correction renforce l’agent</li>
        </ul></div>
    </div>
    <p class="pull rv">« L’objectif n’est pas le risque zéro — c’est d’avoir le <span>même contrôle</span>
      qu’avec vos agents humains. Ou meilleur. »</p>
  </div>
</section>

